## Project Structure

```
app/
  main.py      # FastAPI app, /answers endpoint
  models.py    # Pydantic models (Patient, Question, Answer)
  env.py       # Environment setup
tests/
  unit/
    test_visible_if.py        # Fast unit tests for visible_if logic (no API calls)
  integration/
    test_answers.py           # Integration tests against the /answers endpoint
sample_data/
  patient_data.json                    # Synthetic patient records
  zepbound_question_set.json           # Full PA question set
  example_request_isaiah_reed.json     # New patient example request
  example_response_isaiah_reed.json    # Expected response
  example_request_jeffrey_donovan.json # Continuation patient example request
  example_response_jeffrey_donovan.json
```
